    "the extension is %@" : {
      "comment" : "Rule card when-fragment; list like .zip, .dmg.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扩展名是%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "副檔名是%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fallback folder when no routine's path matches. Add routines for Desktop, Dropbox, or anything else fussy. Loose folders are ordinary directories at the top of the watch folder — Binky can move them as one piece without sorting inside. That skips built-in destinations (Images, Documents, etc.) and sends app bundles to Apps." : {
      "comment" : "Default folder section footer.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后备文件夹用以处理例程整理没有路径匹配的情况。添加桌面、Dropbox 或其他任何繁琐的例程。松散文件夹是监视文件夹顶部的普通目录 - Binky 可以将它们作为一个整体移动，而无需在内部排序。这会跳过内置目标（图像、文档等）并将应用程序包发送到应用程序。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "後備檔案夾用以處理常式整理沒有路徑符合的情況。可為桌面、Dropbox 等加入常式。散落檔案夾是監視檔案夾頂層的普通目錄——Binky 可整體移入目標，不拆分內部檔案。會跳過內建目標（圖片、文件等），App 則傳送到應用程式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
